<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_10> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Overview of Rosemount 3051 integrated DP flow meters: fully assembled and leak tested, factory configured flow rate and totalized flow, reduced straight pipe requirements, and up to 1.65 percent volumetric flow accuracy at 8:1 turndown."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Innovative integrated DP flow meters" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers what volumetric flow accuracy and turndown the integrated DP flow meters claim in the overview."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 4 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_137> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Rosemount 3051CFA ordering section (pp. 29-30) text on sizing and selection with the DP Flow sizing and selection tool and the configuration tool, plus the Model codes intro referring to Figure 3."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Sizing and selection" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find how Rosemount 3051CFA flow meters are sized and how a valid model code is produced."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 29 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_178> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Rosemount 3051CFA ordering section (p. 37) note under Materials conformance: materials comply with NACE MR0175/ISO (sour oil field) and NACE MR0103 (sour refining); option J5 provides Alloy C-276 transmitter diaphragms."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Materials conformance" ;
