<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_362> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Text of the 'Line pressure effect per 1000 psi (68.95 bar)' subsection: for line pressures above 2000 psi (137.90 bar) and Ranges 4-5 it refers to the HART, WirelessHART, FOUNDATION Fieldbus and PROFIBUS PA reference manuals."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Dynamic performance" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers where to find line pressure effect data above 2000 psi for Ranges 4-5; the values up to that are in rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001/table-1."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 79 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_365> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Vibration effect specification: less than ±0.1 percent of URL when tested per IEC60770-1: 1999 for field or pipeline with high vibration level (10-60 Hz 0.21 mm displacement peak amplitude / 60-2000 Hz 3g)."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Vibration effect" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers the vibration effect of the Rosemount 3051 and the test standard and levels used."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 80 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_369> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Transient protection (option code T1) specification in the performance chapter: tested per IEEE C62.41.2-2002, location category B, with 6 kV crest (0.5 µs - 100 kHz), 3 kA crest (8 x 20 µs) and 6 kV crest (1.2 x 50 µs)."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Transient protection (option code T1)" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers to which standard and surge levels the T1 transient protection is tested."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 81 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_401> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Wireless radio data for the internal antenna (WP5 option): frequency 2.400-2.485 GHz, 15 channels, IEEE 802.15.4 compliant DSSS modulation, maximum 10 dBm EIRP transmission."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Wireless radio (internal antenna, WP5 option)" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers the radio frequency, channel count, modulation and transmit power of the wireless transmitter."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 86 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_410> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Output of the 1-5 Vdc HART low power version (output code M): three-wire 1-5 Vdc, linear or square root, HART digital variable superimposed, operating on 6-12 Vdc with no load."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Output" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers the output signal and supply voltage of the low power Rosemount 3051."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 87 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_415> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Overpressure limits for Rosemount 3051CA: Range 1 750 psia (51.71 bar), Range 2 1,500 psia (103.42 bar), Range 3 1,600 psia (110.32 bar), Range 4 6,000 psia (413.69 bar)."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Rosemount 3051CA" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the overpressure limit of a 3051CA transmitter by range."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 87 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_424> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Failure mode alarm for output code M: on gross failure the analog signal is driven below 0.94 V or above 5.4 V, selectable by internal jumper."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Output code M" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers the alarm voltage levels of the low power (code M) transmitter."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 88 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_432> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Turn-on time: within specifications less than 2.0 seconds after power-up (20.0 seconds for PROFIBUS PA and FOUNDATION Fieldbus), not applicable to wireless code X; also volumetric displacement less than 0.005 inch3 (0.08 cm3)."@en ;
