<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_11> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Overview of Rosemount 3051 DP Level technologies: process connections, fill fluids, direct mount or capillary connections, a level configuration wizard with volume measurement, the QZ option for system performance, and Rosemount Tuned-System assemblies."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Proven, reliable, and innovative DP Level technologies" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find what DP Level options and features (QZ, Tuned-System) the 3051 offers."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 4 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_131> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Rosemount 3051CF selection guide entry for the 3051CFA Annubar Flow Meter (p. 28): low material cost in large line sizes, Flo-tap installation without process shutdown, up to 96 percent less permanent pressure loss than orifice plates."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Rosemount 3051CFA Annubar Flow Meter" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the claimed benefits of the Rosemount 3051CFA Annubar flow meter."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 28 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_2> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Rosemount 3051 headline performance claims (p. 2): more than ten million installed, reference accuracy 0.04 percent of span, installed total performance 0.14 percent of span, 10-year stability 0.2 percent of URL, SIL 2/3 certified (IEC 61508)."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Setting the standard for pressure measurement Proven best-in-class performance, reliability, and safety" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers what reference accuracy, total performance, 10-year stability and SIL certification the Rosemount 3051 claims in its overview."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 2 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_256> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Rosemount 3051CFP ordering section (pp. 53-54) text on sizing and selection with the DP Flow sizing and selection tool and the configuration tool, plus the Model codes intro referring to Figure 5."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Sizing and selection" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find how Rosemount 3051CFP flow meters are sized and how a valid model code is produced."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 53 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_292> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Rosemount 3051CFP ordering section (p. 60) note under Materials conformance: materials comply with NACE MR0175/ISO (sour oil field) and NACE MR0103 (sour refining); option J5 provides Alloy C-276 transmitter diaphragms."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Materials conformance" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers which NACE standards the Rosemount 3051CFP materials conformance refers to and what option J5 provides."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 60 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_360> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Definition of the Total performance specification: combined errors of reference accuracy, ambient temperature effect and static pressure effect at 70 percent of span typical reading and 740 psi (51.02 bar) line pressure, for ±50 °F (28 °C) temperature changes, 0-100 percent relative humidity and 1:1 to 5:1 rangedown."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Total performance" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers under which conditions the Rosemount 3051 total performance values (see rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001/table-azure-283) are stated."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 78 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_375> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Load limitations for the 4-20 mA HART output: maximum loop resistance = 43.5 x (power supply voltage - 10.5), minimum 250 ohms loop resistance for communication, plus the axis labels of the load chart (Load, Operating region, Voltage (Vdc))."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Load limitations" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the formula for maximum loop resistance and the minimum loop resistance needed for HART communication; the plotted region is in rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001/fig-82.1/chart-1."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 82 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_379> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Optional configuration buttons for the HART output: quick service buttons (D1: zero, rerange, loop test, view configuration, flip the graphical display), Digital Zero trim (DZ) and Analog Zero and Span (D4)."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Optional configuration buttons" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers what the D1, DZ and D4 configuration button options do."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 83 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_389> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Description of the FOUNDATION Fieldbus Diagnostics Suite (option code D01): SPM technology models the process noise signature (mean and standard deviation) to detect changes such as plugged impulse lines and generate an alert."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "FOUNDATION Fieldbus Diagnostics Suite (option code D01)" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers what the D01 diagnostics suite detects and how it works."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 85 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_406> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Power module of the wireless version: field replaceable, keyed, intrinsically safe lithium-thionyl chloride module with PBT/PC enclosure, ten-year life at one minute update rate."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Power module" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers the type and expected life of the wireless power module."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 86 .

