<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_1> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Front-page introduction of the Rosemount 3051 Pressure Transmitter listing its benefits: reduced product variation and complexity, lower total cost of ownership by using one device across pressure, level and flow applications, and diagnostic information access."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Rosemount™ 3051 Pressure Transmitter" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the general value proposition of the Rosemount 3051 Pressure Transmitter."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 1 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_133> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Rosemount 3051CF selection guide entry for the 3051CFP Integral Orifice Flow Meter (p. 28): small line sizes 1/2 to 11/2 in. (15 to 40 mm), precision honed pipe section, uncertainty reduced by up to five percent versus traditional orifice plate installation."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Rosemount 3051CFP Integral Orifice Flow Meter" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the line size range and claimed benefits of the Rosemount 3051CFP."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 28 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_14> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Introduction to the Rosemount 3051C Coplanar Pressure Transmitter ordering information (p. 5): differential, gage and absolute pressure measurement, with key option codes DA1 (Loop Integrity and Plugged Impulse Line diagnostics), BLE (Bluetooth), M6 (back-lit graphical display) and QT/T9 (safety certification and proof testing)."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Rosemount 3051C Coplanar Pressure Transmitter ordering information" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find which option codes give diagnostics, Bluetooth, display and safety certification on the Rosemount 3051C."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 5 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_414> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Overpressure limits for Rosemount 3051CD/CG/CF: Range 0 750 psi (51.71 bar), Range 1 2,000 psig (137.90 bar), Ranges 2-5 3,626 psig (250.00 bar), or 4500 psig (310.26 bar) with option code P9."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Rosemount 3051CD/CG/CF" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the overpressure limit of a 3051CD, CG or CF transmitter by range."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 87 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_421> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Burst pressure limits for Rosemount 3051T in-line: Ranges 0-4 11,016 psi (759.53 bar), Range 5 26,016 psig (1,793.74 bar), Range 6 46,092 psi (3,177.93 bar)."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Rosemount 3051T in-line" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the burst pressure of a 3051T in-line transmitter by range."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 88 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_443> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Process connections for Rosemount 3051T: 1/2-14 NPT female, G1/2 A DIN 16288 male (ranges 1-4), and Autoclave type F-250-C (ranges 5-6)."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Rosemount 3051T" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers which process connections the 3051T offers per range."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 91 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_447> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Process-wetted transmitter flange and adapter materials: plated CS, SST CF-8M per ASTM A743, cast C-276 CW-12MW per ASTM A494, cast alloy 400 M-30C per ASTM A494, and alloy 400/405 per ASTM B164/B127 for the coplanar flange."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Transmitter flanges and adapters" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers which materials and material standards are used for transmitter flanges and adapters."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 92 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_450> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Rosemount 3051L process-wetted parts: high side diaphragms 316L SST, alloy C-276 or tantalum, extension CF-3M or alloy C-276 (schedule 40 and 80 pipe), mounting flange zinc-cobalt plated CS or SST; low side isolating diaphragms 316L SST or alloy C-276, reference flange and adapter CF-8M."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Rosemount 3051L process wetted parts Flanged process connection (transmitter high side)" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers the wetted materials on the high and low pressure sides of the 3051L."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 92 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_484> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Configuration buttons option text: the 3051 ships without buttons unless D1, D4, DZ or M4 is specified; the wireless transmitter is available with a digital zero button with or without LCD."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Configuration buttons" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers which option codes add local configuration buttons."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 112 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_487> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Bolt options for flanges and adapters: standard plated CS per ASTM A449 Type 1, L4 austenitic 316 SST, L5 ASTM A193 Grade B7M, L6 alloy K-500."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Bolts for flanges and adapters" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers which bolt material each option code L4, L5, L6 gives."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 113 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:table_5> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Table 5 (p. 88): failure mode alarm current levels, high and low alarm, for default (≥21.75 mA / ≤3.75 mA), NAMUR compliant (≥22.5 / ≤3.6 mA) and custom levels (20.2-23.0 / 3.6-3.8 mA)."@en ;
    dcterms:type "table" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Table 5: Failure mode alarm" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the 4-20 mA alarm current for default, NAMUR or custom failure mode settings."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 88 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:table_azure_102> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Rosemount 3051CFA ordering table for piping orientation: H = horizontal piping, D = vertical piping with downward flow, U = vertical piping with upward flow; all starred."@en ;
    dcterms:type "table" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Piping orientation (Rosemount 3051CFA ordering information)" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the piping orientation code of a Rosemount 3051CFA flow meter."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 32 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:table_azure_109> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Rosemount 3051CFA ordering table for isolation valve for Flo-Tap models: 0 = not applicable or customer-supplied (starred), 1 = gate valve CS, 2 = gate valve SST, 5 = ball valve CS, 6 = ball valve SST."@en ;
    dcterms:type "table" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Isolation valve for Flo-Tap models (Rosemount 3051CFA ordering information)" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the Flo-Tap isolation valve code (gate/ball, CS/SST) of a Rosemount 3051CFA."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 34 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:table_azure_120> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Rosemount 3051CFA ordering table for alternate transmitter diaphragm material: ID2 316 SST, ID3 Alloy C-276, ID4 Alloy 400, ID5 Tantalum, ID6 gold-plated Alloy 400 (with graphite-filled PTFE O-ring), ID7 gold-plated SST; ID4-ID7 are not available with wireless output X."@en ;
    dcterms:type "table" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Alternate transmitter diaphragm material (Rosemount 3051CFA ordering information)" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find which diaphragm material each Rosemount 3051CFA ID option code gives and which are excluded for wireless."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 36 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:table_azure_138> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Rosemount 3051CFA ordering table for Plantweb diagnostic functionality: DA0 Loop Integrity diagnostic, DA1 Loop Integrity and Plugged Impulse Line diagnostics, D01 FOUNDATION Fieldbus Diagnostics Suite, with footnotes limiting DA0/DA1 to HART (code A) and low-power (code M) outputs."@en ;
    dcterms:type "table" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Plantweb™ diagnostic functionality (Rosemount 3051CFA ordering information)" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the diagnostic option codes for a Rosemount 3051CFA and which outputs they require."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 39 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:table_azure_14> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Rosemount 3051C ordering table for Plantweb diagnostic functionality: DA0 = Loop Integrity diagnostic (HART code A only), DA1 = Loop Integrity and Plugged Impulse Line diagnostics (outputs A and M; with M only Plugged Impulse Line), D01 = FOUNDATION Fieldbus Diagnostics Suite; all starred."@en ;
    dcterms:type "table" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Plantweb™ diagnostic functionality (Rosemount 3051C ordering information)" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the diagnostic option codes of a Rosemount 3051C and which output each requires."@en ;
