    dcterms:description "Rosemount 3051CF selection guide entry for the 3051CFC Compact Conditioning Flow Meter (p. 28): conditioning orifice plate or Annubar primary elements, only two pipe diameters upstream and downstream, savings up to 55 percent versus a traditional orifice plate installation."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Rosemount 3051CFC Compact Conditioning Flow Meter" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the straight-run requirement and claimed savings of the Rosemount 3051CFC."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 28 .

