<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_308> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Introduction to the Rosemount 3051L Level Transmitter ordering information (p. 64): transmitter with direct mount seal in one model number, with option codes QZ (system performance), S1 (Tuned-System assembly), DA1 (Loop Integrity diagnostic), BLE (Bluetooth), M6 (back-lit display), level configurator (M6, BLE, D1, DA1, T9, RK) and QT/T9 (safety certification)."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Rosemount 3051L Level Transmitter ordering information" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find which option codes give QZ reporting, Tuned-System assembly, diagnostics, Bluetooth, display and safety certification on the Rosemount 3051L."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 64 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:section_468> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Note that the Pak-Lok Annubar model is available up to ASME B16.5 Class 600 rating (1440 psig at 100 °F [99 bar at 38 °C]), followed by view labels and the caption of Figure 22 (3051CFP Integral Orifice flow meter)."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Note" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers the maximum pressure class of the 3051CFA Pak-Lok Annubar; dimensions are in rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001/table-10."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 104 .

