<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:table_azure_54> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Rosemount 3051T ordering table for pressure range codes 0-6 with limits for Gage (3051TG) and Absolute (3051TA) in psi/psia with bar equivalents, from code 0 = -5 to 5 psi (-345 to 345 mbar) gage only up to code 6 = -14.7 to 20000 psi / 0 to 20000 psia (1379 bar); codes 0-5 starred. Footnotes: 3051TG lower limit assumes 14.7 psig atmosphere, range 0 not with wireless X, range 6 not with outputs W/M, inert fill 2, DW or S5."@en ;
    dcterms:type "table" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Pressure range (Rosemount 3051T ordering information)" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the gage and absolute range limits of each Rosemount 3051T range code and range-specific restrictions."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 19 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:table_azure_276> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Rosemount 3051L ordering table (p. 74) of lower housing flushing connection options: F1-F4 and F7-F0 combining ring material (316 SST, Alloy C-276), number of connections (1 or 2) and size (1/4-18 NPT or 1/2-14 NPT), plus FV assemble to Rosemount 319 flushing ring."@en ;
    dcterms:type "table" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Lower housing flushing connection options (Rosemount 3051L ordering information)" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the 3051L flushing connection code for a given ring material, number and NPT size."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 74 .

