<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:table_azure_2> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Rosemount 3051C ordering table for pressure range codes 0-5, giving the range limits per measurement type: Differential (3051CD), Gage (3051CG) and Absolute (3051CA) in inH2O/psi/psia with mbar/bar equivalents, e.g. code 1 = -25 to +25 inH2O DP/GP and 0 to 30 psia AP, code 5 = -2000 to +2000 psi DP, N/A for absolute. A footnote restricts 3051CD0 (-3 to +3 inH2O) to outputs A and X with specific flange, diaphragm, O-ring and bolting options."@en ;
    dcterms:type "table" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Pressure range (Rosemount 3051C ordering information)" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the pressure range limits of each Rosemount 3051C range code for differential, gage and absolute versions."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 7 .

<urn:plantdocs:rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001:source:table_6> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Table 6 (p. 90): process connection temperature limits in °F and °C for 3051CD/CG/CF/CA (silicone and inert fill, by flange type, option BR6), 3051T, 3051L low side, and 3051L high side by fill fluid (SYLTHERM XLT, Silicone 704, Silicone 200, Inert, glycerin and water, Neobee M-20, propylene glycol and water), with vacuum and derating footnotes."@en ;
    dcterms:type "table" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Table 6: Process Connection Temperature Limits" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "rosemount-3051-00813-0100-4001.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the process temperature limits for a Rosemount 3051 model, fill fluid and flange."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 90 .

